Package: DepCensAudit
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Audit Framework for Censoring in Survival Data:
    Evaluation, Positivity, and Extrapolation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Xinghua", "Ma", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maxh_sky@126.com",
    comment = "South China Agricultural University, Zhujiang College")
Description: Phase A (engineering integration) of the DepCens-Audit
    framework. Provides diagnostic audits for survival analyses with
    censored data across three dimensions: (A) evaluation audit
    (IPCW-based IBS under dependent censoring), (B) positivity audit
    (continuous sensitivity intervals for the censoring mechanism), and
    (C) extrapolation audit (three-model comparison, rho instability and
    maturity criteria, and mapping to probabilistic sensitivity analysis
    strategies for health technology assessment). Outputs are diagnostic
    only; the package does not judge regulatory compliance. The
    cross-dimensional interaction pathway is reserved as a frozen
    interface for a later methodology release and is not implemented in
    this version.
